import source_search_model.dl
import source_transactions.dl

to get [replace UI source search in] {a pointer to UI source editor:editor} [all] {boolean:all} [in] {a pointer to UI view:view}:
    refresh UI source search in editor in view
    set model to the address of (editor's search's model)
    if (the length of (model's matches)) = 0:
        return false
    if ((editor's document's writable) and (the UI element (editor's node) accepts edits in (view's instance))) = false:
        return false
    set replacement to UI search text labeled "Replace text" in editor
    set edits to a new JSON-RPC array
    set index to 0
    loop while index < the length of (model's matches):
        if all or (index = model's current):
            set match to the item at index in (model's matches)
            set range to a JSON object containing [
                JSON child "start" is (the UI analysis position for source byte (match's start) in (editor's document)),
                JSON child "end" is (the UI analysis position for source byte (match's end) in (editor's document))
            ]
            add (a JSON object containing [JSON child "range" is range, JSON text "newText" is replacement]) to the JSON array edits
        increment index
    set payload to a JSON object containing [JSON child "changes" is (a JSON object containing [JSON child (editor's document's uri) is edits])]
    set transaction to a UI source transaction applying payload for editor in view
    free payload
    set accepted to commit UI source transaction (the address of transaction) in view
    set editor's search's error to transaction's reason
    free UI source transaction (the address of transaction)
    refresh UI source search in editor in view
    return accepted
